  "definition": "Certification Process",
  "effectiveDate": "2019-12-06",
  "historyNote": "#8595, eff 4-1-06; amd by #9899-A, eff 3-29-11, (paras (b)-(p)); amd by #9899-B, eff 3-29-11 (para (a)); ss by #12740, INTERIM, eff 3-20-19, EXPIRED: 9-16-19 New. #12934, eff 12-6-19",
